1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,600
If the zombie apocalypse starts while you're in the parking lot, don't run to your car.

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:09,286
Running is fear in motion. The dead hear it.

3
00:00:10,849 --> 00:00:14,106
Walk. Keys in hand. Slow breaths.

4
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:20,227
Calm gets you to the car. Fear gets you noticed.
